From: Zurker <91011862+hershate@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:45:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] batch 178 (R37): aquifer pressure memo to field +
 single-point context scratch + geode indexed loops + monster-room scan
 scratch

- Aquifer: per-call NaN-sentinel MutableDouble memo hoisted to an instance
  field (one aquifer per NoiseChunk, single generation worker thread);
  reset-on-entry is value-identical to a fresh cell.
- PapoContextScratch: public thread-local mutable FunctionContext stand-in;
  Climate.Sampler.sample and WorldCarver.getCarveState stage their
  per-position SinglePointContext in it (consumers coordinate-read-only,
  synchronous, no reentrancy, no instanceof/equals on FunctionContext).
- GeodeFeature: the two point lists become ArrayLists walked by indexed
  loops - LinkedList was allocated per outer betweenClosed position
  (up to 33^3 per geode); append-only + insertion-order iteration keeps the
  order identical.
- MonsterRoomFeature: room-solidity scan loop stages its probe position in a
  thread-local MutableBlockPos (coordinate-read-only queries; build loops
  keep immutable positions since they write and query below() before reuse).

